    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumwaka wekumi nakayedi, mukakweji kekumi nakayedi, mwifuku dakakweji dakusambila, izu daYehova denjili kudami, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindi, Eyi mwana kamuntu, mudilili mwanta wakuEjipitu Fwaro mukeŋa, wumwili neyi, Eyi akufwikijili neyi mwenzi wamutupa wamunyuza. Komana kweyi, wuchanzaŋombi wamutuluŋalwiji. Hiwukutupukamu hamu natuloŋa tweyi, hiwukuvundula meji nanyendu yeyi, hiwukuvundaŋesha tuloŋa twawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta Yehova nindi, Nakakutandumwina wanda wami hewulu, hamu nachendu chanyuza yawantu yayivulu; akakukandwisha muwanda wami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakakushiya heseki, nakakunatila hampata yamukunkulwayi, nakakupompeshela atujila ahaluzwizu ejima akawilawili hadeyi, nakekutisha anyama amwisaŋa dejima nambiji yeyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakanatanata mbiji yeyi hamapidi, nakenzesha yinekineki namavunu eyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakazowesha ituŋa namashi eyi, akechikila nikumapidi; nitupila twameji twakenzala naneyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chinakakujima nakabuta iwulu, nakeyilisha tutumbwa tudumu. Nakabuta itaŋwa nevu, nikakweji hakatoŋeka nawa mweji winduku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuma yejima yasweja kutoŋeka mwiwulu nakayiyilisha hewulu deyi, nakasha mwidima hetuŋa deyi. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Mwanta Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chinakashimuna kukisika kweyi munyuza, mumatuŋa iwabulili kwiluka, nakavuloka antu amavulu, akazuwa munyichima yawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakahayamisha nyuza yayivulu nansaŋu yeyi, nianyanta jawu akazaala woma nankashi nansaŋu yeyi, chinakabimba nampoku yami yakabali kumesu awu; ifuku diwakadimbukeyi akazaala ora jejima, iwu nakuzaalila wumi windi, iwu nakuzaalila wumi windi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa Mwanta Yehova nindi, Mpoku yamwanta wakuBabiloni yakabali yakakuwana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumwaka wekumi nakayedi, mwifuku dakakweji dekumi nakatanu, izu daYehova denjili kudami, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindi, Eyi mwana kamuntu, tumpilaku luntu lwakuEjipitu ikumbu, wuyikunkumwishi niyena nianyana awambanda amunyuza yalema mumashina amaseki, hamu nanawa akukunkumuka muwina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wunabadiki mukwenwinyi kuwaha? Kunkumukaku akukamiki hamu nawayidima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akadimbukila mukachi kanawa ajahawu dehi nampoku yakabali. Anamwinki dehi kumpoku yakabali. Mukokenu nichintu chindi chachivulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayilobu asweja Ŋovu akahosha nindi mukaluŋa hamu nanawa amukwashaŋa, nawu, Anakunkumuki dehi, anakami dehi zo-o, ayidima ajahawu dehi nampoku yakabali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ashuri wudi kwenoku nichendu chindi chejima. Majamu indi anamunyeŋumuki kwi-ndo. Wejima wawu wowu ajahawu dehi, wowu adimbuka dehi kumpoku yakabali; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "diwu akweti majamu awu ashawu dehi kunsa jawina, nichendu chindi chejima chinanyeŋumuki ŋamu dindi. Wejima wawu wowu ajahawu dehi, wowu adimbuka dehi kumpoku yakabali, wowu afwishilaŋa akwawu mutentu mwituŋa dawamomi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elami wudi kwenoku niluntu lwindi lwejima lunanyeŋumuki ŋamu dindi kwi-ndo. Wejima wawu wowu ajahawu dehi, wowu adimbuka dehi kumpoku yakabali, wowu akunkumuka dehi nawudima wawu mumashina amaseki, wowu afwishilaŋa akwawu mutentu wawu mwituŋa dawamomi, anayi dehi nansonyi jawu hamu nanawa akukunkumuka muwina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asha dehi kadidi kindi mukachi kanawa ajahawu dehi, hamu naluntu lwindi lwejima. Majamu indi anamunyeŋumuki kwi-ndo. Wejima wawu wowu ayidima, wowu ajahawu dehi nampoku yakabali; muloŋa afwishilaŋa akwawu mutentu wawu mwituŋa dawamomi, anayi dehi nansonyi jawu hamu nanawa akukunkumuka muwina. Anamushi dehi mukachi kanawa ajahawu dehi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mesheki wudi kwenoku, niTubali niluntu lwindi lwejima. Majamu indi anamunyeŋumuki kwi-ndo. Wejima wawu wowu ayidima, wowu ajahawu dehi nampoku yakabali; muloŋa afwishilaŋa akwawu mutentu wawu mwituŋa dawamomi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakakama hamu nawayilobu awayidima anadimbuki, anakunkumuki mukaluŋa hamu nayitwa yawu yanjita, anasachili nyitu yawu hampoku jawu jatubali hamakoshi awu, kuluwa kwawu kudi hamafwahawuku. Muloŋa wena afwishilaŋa ayilobu mutentu mwituŋa dawamomi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakwila eyi akakukotwela mukachi kawayidima, wakakama hamu nanawa ajahawu dehi nampoku yakabali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
