          "text": "Fwaro chakayimonayi akamukundeja nansaŋu yaluntu lwindi lwejima, yowu yomweni Fwaro ninjita yindi yejima yajahawu dehi nampoku yakabali. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Mwanta Yehova. ",
