        {
          "text": "Muloŋa ami nasha dehi jakuŋufwa mutentu mwituŋa dawamomi. Akamukamika mukachi kawayidima hamu nanawa ajahawu dehi nampoku yakabali, yowu yomweni Fwaro niluntu lwindi lwejima. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Mwanta Yehova.",
